OL,3,GNEWSAWorkhouse museum seeks memories of
OL,4,Atime as care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum at a former Victorian
OL,7,Fworkhouse is appealing for people's
OL,8,Fmemories of the time when it was turned
OL,9,Finto a care home after World War Two.
OL,11,FGressenhall Farm and Workhouse is based
OL,12,Fat buildings that date from 1777 which
OL,13,Fare celebrating their 250th anniversary
OL,14,Fnext year.
OL,16,FIn the 1940s, it was turned into a care
OL,17,Fhome and renamed Beech House. It closed
OL,18,Fin 1975 with residents being moved to
OL,19,FHolt and Costessey.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
