OL,3,GNEWSAWorkhouse museum seeks memories of
OL,4,Atime as care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurator Rachel Kidd said the
OL,7,Fanniversary might be the "last chance"
OL,8,Fto capture the accounts of people who
OL,9,Flived, visited and worked there.
